#: scenario8:scenario8_BDDB89C8_BF1B_4F06_98A0_A51AED4774F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10d3ed85c32f4e0e997c5793c019c493c86db16a11283f2719b2ed2d3d079f0e
