msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9009B8D8_4D54_46F9_846E_CF8623E0DCBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫which, as I recall from Morgana’s account, nearly drained the church of everything "
"it had once."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫что, насколько я помню из слов Морганы, практически истощило все припасы церкви."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FE65475_AEDE_48B8_9A4C_9F63D44F3EA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24388d08b405d1c46b1f867fa7a50daf505ceb11113ad8201fc5f401825539ca
