msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫В чем проблема?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5201CFEB_D918_47B4_8E7A_F30BE7EB309B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29a86f64d63051d7196a94821a69b53d774464585e55c3eab090fe89318f1899
